{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03017","headline":"忝官二十年尽在内职及爲郡尝积恋因赋诗焉 · 张九龄","name":"忝官二十年尽在内职及爲郡尝积恋因赋诗焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江流去朝宗，昼夜兹不舍。\n仲尼在川上，子牟存阙下。\n圣达有由然，孰是无心者。\n一郡苟能化，百城岂云寡。\n爱礼谁爲羊，恋主吾犹马。\n感初时不载，思奋翼无假。\n闲宇常自闭，沈心何用写。\n揽衣步前庭，登陴临旷野。\n白水生迢递，清风寄潇洒。\n愿言采芳泽，终朝不盈把。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}